--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Fonts
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

nordstern bundles no font files and loads none. The families named in
css/tokens.css — Avenir Next, Avenir, Futura, Century Gothic, URW Gothic,
Trebuchet MS, Helvetica Neue, SF Mono, JetBrains Mono, Menlo — are requests
to whatever is already installed on the reader's machine, and each falls
through to the next until the generic sans-serif or monospace. Those names
are trademarks of their respective owners; no font software is distributed
with this project, and none is fetched at runtime. tests/build.mjs fails the
build if an @font-face rule or a remote font host ever appears.

